  1. Door sells paused install as first-machine (PV1-1, PV2-H1). Proof: `../openOODA.github.io/index.html`.
  2. Registry sold as a finished store (PV1-2, PV2-H6). Proof: guide Packages, registry HTML.
  3. `ooda install` prints ok (PV1-3). Proof: `../ooda/cli/cmd_more.oo`.
  4. Public text sells residual or moonshot as product (PV2-H2..H5). Proof: door Defense, Use.oot HITL, Options GpuCap, Research Production LLVM.
  5. Public leftover `.md` (HYG-1, HYG-2). Proof: `../registry/README.md`, `../wiki/README.md`.
